  "wikitext": "{{Short description|Species of grass}}\n{{Speciesbox\n|genus = Festuca\n|species = jubata\n|image = Festuca_jubata.jpg\n|authority = [[Richard Thomas Lowe|Lowe]]\n|synonyms = \n* ''Festuca glauca'' var. ''longearistata'' Hochst. ex Seub. in Fl. Azor.: 20 (1840)\n|synonyms_ref =  <ref name=\"kew\"/>\n}}\n\n'''''Festuca jubata''''' is a species of grass in the family [[Poaceae]]. It is native to [[Azores]] and [[Madeira]]. It is a [[perennial]] and mainly grows in temperate [[Biome|biomes]]. It was first published in 1838.<ref name=\"kew\">{{cite web |title=''Festuca jubata'' Lowe |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:402924-1#synonyms |access-date=2023-01-18}}</ref>\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Taxonbar|from=Q10282030}}\n\n[[Category:Festuca|jubata]]\n[[Category:Plants described in 1840]]\n\n\n{{Festuca-stub}}",
